A Quiet Place Part II is a science fiction, thriller,
horror film directed by John Krasinski.

3
00:10:17,142 --> 00:10:23,142
Following the events at home, the Abbott family now
face the terrors of the outside world.

4
00:13:42,857 --> 00:13:48,857
Forced to venture into the unknown, they realize that the creatures that hunt by
sound are not the only threats that lurk beyond the sand path.

